+Now let me read all test files to understand what's expected.
+
+Now I have a clear picture of all the bugs. Let me fix them all.
+
+**Bug 1**: EventBus uses module-level handlers instead of instance-scoped — causes handler leaks across tests.
+**Bug 2**: `handleRefund` in BillingService missing `.bind(this)`.
+**Bug 3**: `OrderRepository.update` doesn't merge with existing record.
+**Bug 4**: Refund window check uses `>=` instead of `>`, rejecting exactly day 30.
+**Bug 5**: `calculateOrderTotal` does intermediate rounding, causing penny-edge errors.
+
+Now let me run tests to verify all fixes.
+
